{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":24857,"name":"Mark Fisher","username":"Fisher","avatar_template":"/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/a8b319/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-06-21T12:01:45.242Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e作为一个天天盼着 nervos 出一款大众爆款应用的技术盲，我又来头脑风暴了。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e一种交互上类似 Tinder 的应用（我真没用过），通过左滑右滑来对卡片话题下注“是”和“否”，不感兴趣就划走。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e可以结合 Fiber 适合小额多次支付的特性，主打一个小赌怡情，而不必像 polymarket 一样总是一局定生死。可以设置一个默认赌注金额比如五毛钱，然后每天对着感兴趣的话题划来划去就可以了。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e理念上有点接近拼多多，为购物（下注）增加更多娱乐性。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e可以为赌注话题创作者设置一个1%抽成，鼓励构思大家感兴趣的赌注话题，生成的赌注话题放在链上占用 ckb，赌注结束后再销毁归还赌注创作者。\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-06-21T12:01:45.242Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":41,"readers_count":40,"score":133.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":10407,"topic_slug":"tinder","display_username":"Mark Fisher","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":6}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":3764,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/tinder/10407/1","babel_translations_meta":[{"language":"en","status":"completed","source_language":"auto"},{"language":"es","status":"completed","source_language":"auto"}],"show_translation_widget":true,"show_translation_button":true,"babel_detected_locale":"zh-cn","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":6}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":6,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false,"can_translate":false},{"id":26336,"name":"","username":"ArthurZhang","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/talk.nervos.org/arthurzhang/{size}/11070_2.png","created_at":"2026-10-03T08:59:17.290Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi Fisher,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI think this is technically feasible now.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith CKB handling the market state / settlement and Fiber providing the micropayment layer, most of the primitives needed for this kind of high-frequency, small-value interaction are already there.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe bigger issue, in my view, is no longer implementation but liquidity bootstrapping, especially the initial LP depth for each market. A Tinder-like UX potentially creates a \u003cstrong\u003every large number of small markets\u003c/strong\u003e, so liquidity can become fragmented very quickly. Even if the protocol has reasonable total TVL, each individual card may still be too shallow to provide a meaningful price or smooth entry/exit.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis can partly be avoided with pari-mutuel or peer-matching designs, but if we want Polymarket-like instant execution and continuous pricing, somebody still needs to \u003cstrong\u003eseed the markets.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":2,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-10-03T08:59:17.290Z","reply_count":2,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":2,"reads":29,"readers_count":28,"score":100.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":10407,"topic_slug":"tinder","display_username":"","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"Newbie","title_is_group":false,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":3}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":4255,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/tinder/10407/2","babel_translations_meta":[{"language":"es","status":"completed","source_language":"en"},{"language":"zh-cn","status":"completed","source_language":"en"}],"show_translation_widget":true,"show_translation_button":true,"babel_detected_locale":"en","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":3}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":3,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_translate":false},{"id":26340,"name":"Mark Fisher","username":"Fisher","avatar_template":"/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/a8b319/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-10-04T10:06:47.814Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e感谢打捞，不懂技术，纯尝试贡献灵感，希望 ckb 早日诞生 mass adoption 的应用 \u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/images/emoji/apple/heart_eyes.png?v=15\" title=\":heart_eyes:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":heart_eyes:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":3,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-10-04T10:06:47.814Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":2,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":3,"reads":22,"readers_count":21,"score":79.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":10407,"topic_slug":"tinder","display_username":"Mark Fisher","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","reply_to_user":{"id":4255,"username":"ArthurZhang","name":"","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/talk.nervos.org/arthurzhang/{size}/11070_2.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":2}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":3764,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/tinder/10407/3","babel_translations_meta":[{"language":"en","status":"completed","source_language":"zh-cn"},{"language":"es","status":"completed","source_language":"zh-cn"}],"show_translation_widget":true,"show_translation_button":true,"babel_detected_locale":"zh-cn","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":2}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":2,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_translate":false},{"id":26542,"name":"Mark Fisher","username":"Fisher","avatar_template":"/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/a8b319/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-10-12T05:17:42.952Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e关于初始流动性，不知道可不可以类比早年的微博问答模式，粉丝花费100元向大V提问题，大V回答后赚到100，之后有人如果对这个问题感兴趣需要付费查看，然后最开始提出问题的粉丝就可以从中赚钱了。回到这个长尾/利基预测市场平台，提交预测题干就相当于提问题，也可以类比成发射meme币，需要提供比如100刀流动性，后续只要参与的人多起来Ta就能从中盈利，这样也能激励所提预测的质量。\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":4,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-10-12T05:17:42.952Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":2,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":12,"readers_count":11,"score":32.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":10407,"topic_slug":"tinder","display_username":"Mark Fisher","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","reply_to_user":{"id":4255,"username":"ArthurZhang","name":"","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/talk.nervos.org/arthurzhang/{size}/11070_2.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":2}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":3764,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_histor